 ## Background
-The method originates from the need to visualize Fire Dynamics Simulation (FDS) data in Smokeview, where world coordinates must be mapped to a normalized grid for interactive viewing [S1, unofficial]. It is also used in mesh normalization pipelines like DCX to standardize scene scales [S2, unofficial], and in CUDA-accelerated volume renderers like cuVRender for efficient voxel indexing [S3, unofficial].
